Remove the Share button from the web UI.

Drops Share from the chat header, its dropdown and the mobile three-dot menu,
and from each session row's menu in the sidebar (kebab and right-click). The
Settings → Sharing admin page and the server's sharing API are unchanged.
Upstream's tests of the Share affordances check that they're gone.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).
